/target
/build
.DS_Store
AppleTree.dmg
__pycache__/
/.cache
/.build
# The benchmark harness is its own Cargo project with its own target dir.
/bench/target/
# Local Aegis method-pack workspace: kept on disk for the owner, never
# committed. Its history was removed from this repository in full.
/docs/aegis/
# Under docs/, only benchmarks/, screenshots/ and wiki/ are tracked. Everything
# else (local aegis workspace, app-store metadata, OS junk) stays ignored.
/docs/*
!/docs/benchmarks/
!/docs/screenshots/
# wiki/ holds the privacy policy the app BUNDLES: the `bundle` target copies
# docs/wiki/Privacy-Policy.md into Contents/Resources, so a fresh clone needs
# it or `make bundle` fails outright. app-store-metadata.md stays local.
!/docs/wiki/
# The committed captures are the tuned .webp files; the .png originals that
# store-screenshots.py writes are local scratch and never committed.
/docs/screenshots/*.png
# Video scratch dir: source recording copy, analysis frames, encode variants.
# The demo itself is hosted on the GitHub CDN; nothing here is committed.
/video_work/
